+/-
+  Thanks to @plp127
+
+  https://leanprover.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/ascending.2Fdecending.20lemmata.20related.20.60Set.60.20and.20.60Finset.60/near/539367015
