+lemma provable_iff_boxed [InjectiveBox F] : (□'X) *⊢[𝓢] φ ↔ ∃ Δ : List F, (∀ ψ ∈ □'Δ, ψ ∈ □'X) ∧ (□'Δ) ⊢[𝓢] φ := by
