+# S5-CLM-00003489 — Boxdot Conjecture
+
+This directory is the target-local handoff for
+`S5THM-00003489-TARGET--worker` in run `r-1786535096-11a44404`. It binds the
+frozen `FC-SORRY` record `Arxiv.«1308.0994».BoxdotConjecture` to the current
+Stage6 alias `S6-CLM-00004700` / `S6-VAR-00006743`.
+
+The checked root is
+`AwesomeTheorems.Stage5.Theorems.S5_CLM_00003489.theorem_complete`.
+`Statement.lean` reconstructs the frozen syntax, proof systems, logic record,
+and proposition. `Proof.lean` vendors and re-elaborates the pinned Foundation
+modal infrastructure, proves explicit source/Foundation adapters, specializes
+Jeřábek's strong boxdot theorem to KT, and closes the exact proposition.
+`Audit.lean` checks both statement transports and prints the root dependencies.
+
+The JSON ledgers bind identity, source anchors, the ten-node proof/readability
+DAG, trust closure, and the cold replay receipt. The source provider's
+placeholder body is excluded from proof evidence. The local root was rebuilt
+at trust level zero and reports only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and
+`Quot.sound`; `sorryAx` is absent.
+
+This is a self-tested provisional handoff. Canonical Master review remains
+required before repository-level acceptance.
